@host = https://localhost:7167
@apiKey = secret-key

### Dev diagnostics (no API key in Development)
GET {{host}}/api/diag

### Create chat session (UserId must exist in AspNetUsers)
POST {{host}}/api/ai-chat/sessions
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "title": "Test session"
}

### Send chat message (replace sessionId)
POST {{host}}/api/ai-chat/messages
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "message": "Hello"
}

### Upload text knowledge
POST {{host}}/api/knowledge/upload-text
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "text": "Sample knowledge for RAG."
}
